  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::MechaBloom.LevelConfig
  levelNumber: 10
  levelName: Level 10 - Locked Root
  objectiveText: Power the root lock, then route water to the plant behind it.
  actionLimit: 9
  energyBudget: 14
  requiredBloomCount: 2
  star3ActionLimit: 5
  star2ActionLimit: 7
  star1ActionLimit: 9
  hintText: The green energy route is the key path; the water route should open after
    the locked root is released.
  tutorialMessages:
  - Locked roots block progress until powered.
  - Energy cores and green plant beds communicate the unlock route.
  - After unlocking, finish the water route to the hidden plant bed.
